# Showcase for `agk record` (the README video): the farright.agk route - run,
# jump the three pits, stomp all three mushrooms - with hops while the last
# one walks up, then back left into pit 3 (the falling whistle) and a respawn.
#   agk record demo/showcase.agk -o showcase.mp4 --gif showcase.gif
# Host-simulated route: inputs are timed to the enemies, so don't add waits
# before the end.
wait-serial "AGK t0"
press right 50              # hop onto mushroom 0...
press right+up 1
press right 30
wait 30
press right 70              # pit 1
press right+up 1
press right 40
press right 112             # hop onto mushroom 1
press right+up 1
press right 23
wait 40
press right 23              # pit 2
press right+up 1
press right 40
press right 83              # pit 3
press right+up 1
press right 30
press up 1                  # hop while mushroom 2 walks up (it patrols under the low slab)
wait 44
press up 1
wait 44
press up 1
wait 44
press up 1
wait 44
press up 1
wait 44
press up 1
wait 44
press up 1
wait 44
wait 1
press right+up 1
press right 13
wait 50
press right 120
wait 20
press left 125              # back into pit 3
wait 60                     # whistle, respawn at the start
expect-serial "stomps=3"
expect-serial "AGK sfx fall"
expect-serial "deaths=1"
